<title>AUSTRIA: Lenzing 1996 EPS -66 ATS vs 41 in 1995.</title>
<headline>Lenzing 1996 EPS -66 ATS vs 41 in 1995.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian fibre maker Lenzing's 1996 loss per share was at 66 schillings, after earnings of 41 schillings per share a year earlier, the Austrian Association of Analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company last week reported a net loss of 157.4 million schillings in 1996 after a profit of 253.7 million schillings and said it would scrap its dividend. The company forecast market conditions would remain difficult throughout the year. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
